actory.\n\n### How the fix addresses the bug:\n- **Original bug:** `https://www.youtube.com/https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKvfzCyVQPe2IYg4PkugvWQ`\n- **After fix:** `https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKvfzCyVQPe2IYg4PkugvWQ`"}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":113516,"output_tokens":523,"cache_read_input_tokens":113184,"total_tokens":114039}}}
